<title>USA: Benchmark Electronics trades on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Benchmark Electronics trades on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>ANGLETON, Texas 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benchmark Electronics Inc said Thursday its common stock had begun trading on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol BHE.</p>
<p>Benchmark said its stock previously traded on the American Stock Exchange under the same symbol.</p>
